,"title":"太和二年素利死，其子年小","accounts":[{"id":"wuhuan-a-8dfab34891aeb62cb31c","label":"正文","text":"太和二年素利死，其子年小","evidence":["wuhuan-q-a400e3039ab76e291d6f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mantian-p0036","role":"太和二年死、其子年小的东部鲜卑大人","evidence":["wuhuan-q-a400e3039ab76e291d6f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"太和二年","precision":"undated","basis":"保留原纪年及粒度；本账户未独立归一公元年，不继承相邻事件年份。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-a400e3039ab76e291d6f"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuhuan-q-a400e3039ab76e291d6f","order":6207}],"persons":[{"id":"mantian-p0036","name":"素利","evidence":["mantian-q-7feae76c4ad0f4c2d7c4","mantian-q-e6fe10dac7928f603de7","mantian-q-e9bbf169cf85718cf3ae","mantian-q-f14f222186cd9f8f9a85","mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4","wuhuan-q-02ebfd28c266a4a6c652","wuhuan-q-4823a43362f16438494a","wuhuan-q-291613c697594c93d058","wuhuan-q-b29cf38e1e172abf2c5a","wuhuan-q-cf91bcfa117b367f7b5a","wuhuan-q-04c1e38d918e22af9740","wuhuan-q-a6bcb3f58b71280dfac9","wuhuan-q-a400e3039ab76e291d6f","wuhuan-q-9b791aed7db4668ccc96"],"facts":[{"id":"wuhuan-f-b58c1fc34e8c6552fda5","text":"在辽西、右北平、渔阳塞外的鲜卑大人。","evidence":["wuhuan-q-9b791aed7db4668ccc96"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mantian-q-7feae76c4ad0f4c2d7c4","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-f98461219d42ba544b4b","layer":"original","quote":"文帝践阼，拜招使持节、护鲜卑校尉，屯昌平〖1〗。是时，边民流散山泽；又亡叛在鲜卑中者，处有千数。招广布恩信，招诱降附。建义中郎将公孙集等〖2〗，率将部曲，咸各归命；使还本郡。又怀来鲜卑素利、弥加等十余万落〖3〗；皆令款塞","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":235,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-8782421387a30aa0e9f4","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-1e9ad340e7a92f2569f9","layer":"pei","quote":"鲜卑素利等，数来客见，多以牛马遗豫；豫转送官。胡以为前所与豫物，显露，不如持金。乃密怀金三十斤，谓豫曰：‘愿避左右，我欲有所道。’豫从之，胡因跪曰：‘我见公贫，故前后遗公牛马；公辄送官。今密以此上公，可以为家资。’豫张袖受之，答其厚意。胡去之后，皆悉付外，具以状闻","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-b38ada4d67ad27c8e27e","start":10,"end":142,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-e6fe10dac7928f603de7","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-f8d8a89a32857ae8f96b","layer":"original","quote":"自高柳以东〖4〗，涉貊以西〖5〗，鲜卑数十部；比能、弥加、素利割地统御〖6〗，各有分界。乃共要誓：皆不得以马与中国市","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":141,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":46,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-e9bbf169cf85718cf3ae","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-7f6f254bf33b511a75d0","layer":"original","quote":"素利违盟，出马千匹与官；为比能所攻，求救于豫。豫恐遂相兼并，为害滋深；宜救善讨恶，示信众狄；单将锐卒，深入虏庭。胡人众多，抄军前后，断截归路","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":142,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-f14f222186cd9f8f9a85","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-3f695bccd548965fa3a4","layer":"original","quote":"山贼高艾，众数千人，寇抄，为幽、冀害。豫诱使鲜卑素利部斩艾，传首京都〖14〗。封豫长乐亭侯","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":144,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-02ebfd28c266a4a6c652","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-be79ed42c10f35995307","layer":"original","quote":"后与东部鲜卑大人素利及步度根三部争斗，更相攻击","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":98,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-04c1e38d918e22af9740","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4dd367fecb7f6c7610ef","layer":"original","quote":"文帝立素利、弥加为归义王","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":98,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-291613c697594c93d058","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4dd367fecb7f6c7610ef","layer":"original","quote":"建安中，因阎柔上贡献，通市","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":48,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-4823a43362f16438494a","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-6c1febf5c40896791519","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖17〗，比能复击素利","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-9b791aed7db4668ccc96","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4dd367fecb7f6c7610ef","layer":"original","quote":"素利、弥加、厥机皆为大人，在辽西、右北平、渔阳塞外；道远，初不为边患〖29〗，然其种众多于比能。建安中，因阎柔上贡献，通市；太祖皆表宠以为王。厥机死，又立其子沙末汗为亲汉王。延康初，又各遣使献马。文帝立素利、弥加为归义王。素利与比能更相攻击。太和二年，素利死，子小。以弟成律归为王，代摄其众。","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":146,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-a400e3039ab76e291d6f","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4dd367fecb7f6c7610ef","layer":"original","quote":"太和二年，素利死，子小","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":121,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-a6bcb3f58b71280dfac9","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4dd367fecb7f6c7610ef","layer":"original","quote":"素利与比能更相攻击","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":111,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-b29cf38e1e172abf2c5a","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4dd367fecb7f6c7610ef","layer":"original","quote":"太祖皆表宠以为王","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-cf91bcfa117b367f7b5a","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-4dd367fecb7f6c7610ef","layer":"original","quote":"延康初，又各遣使献马","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":75,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":87,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
